 | Close to mean, saves 224 in fees, but holds more stock |\n| 1 | 561 (+54) | 449 (~0%) | Too much item 0, likely spoilage |\n| 2 | 485 (−22) | 427 (−4.5%) | Under-orders; each missed unit costs 12 (item 0) or 9 (item 1) |\n| 0 | 583 (+76) | 513 (+15%) | Over-orders both items heavily |\n| 3 | 504 | 428 | Extra storage (~500) outweighs the fee saving; item 1 at mean with no carry-over |\n| 5 | — | — | Extra ~784 in fees |\n\n**Conclusion.** Plans 4 and 7 look strongest. I put plan 6 third, ahead of plan 1, because its fee saving should cover its extra storage. Plans 1, 2 and 0 are the close calls for fourth place. Plans 3 and 5 are likely in the bottom half."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5050, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5050}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T07:52:29.041Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWAVoKqhZToY1AEmDygc"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01NkBdM2AA1ifUyYbEQJRSeL", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWAVoZyTc9vQ3hG2FTgT", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01NkBdM2AA1ifUyYbEQJRSeL", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.35, 0.55, 0.4, 0.25, 0.75, 0.1, 0.55, 0.75]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "